# Normalisasi line ending: LF di semua OS (Windows/Mac/Linux).
# mencegah diff palsu (CRLF vs LF) dan konflik antar anggota tim.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Biner — jangan pernah dinormalisasi atau dianggap teks.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
